      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In this scene focused on the deal, chef Viktor agrees to make the sushi himself, but only if Kristina brings Vika back to the restaurant. Let's listen closely to Chef Viktor and Kristina's exchange in Russian first, and then walk through each line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
